    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## **Age-Based Access Rules**\r\n\r\nPlan how your video streaming platform decides what content users can access.\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Choose two **True/False questions** (your conditions).\r\n\r\n2. Build a **flowchart** using those questions to make decisions.\r\n\r\n3. Create **four outcomes**. For each outcome, decide which **image** and **message** will be shown.\r\n\r\n4. Complete the **Test Cases table** to show how each combination of True/False leads to a specific result.\r\n\r\n5. Save your flowchart to your **Backpack**.\r\n",
    "display_name": "Age-Based Access Rules",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Map out how your platform decides what content users can or cannot see based on their age.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/2dc6a805f2647c11d5c904aee3987316-ChatGPT Image Apr 16, 2026, 03_43_27 PM.png",
